title: CH1_M1_OPEN_LAPTOP
---
// M1: tim tai lieu (tren laptop/PC)
<<set_milestone 1>>
<<switch_ui "pc">>

Minh: "De xem thu co tai lieu gi khong..."
Minh: "Ui, bai dang free tai lieu cho tan sinh vien."

-> Mo link tai lieu
    <<jump CH1_M1_OPEN_LINK>>
-> Hoi Quan/Huy
    <<jump CH1_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES>>
-> Bo qua vi thay hoi nghi
    <<jump CH1_M1_SKIP>>
===

title: CH1_M1_OPEN_LINK
---
<<trace TRACE_OPEN_UNVERIFIED_LINK 1>>
Minh: "Trang nay bat dang nhap..."

-> Dang nhap tai khoan
    <<jump CH1_M1_SUBMIT_CREDENTIAL>>
-> Dong lai, thay bat thuong
    <<jump CH1_M1_CLOSE_LINK>>
===

title: CH1_M1_SUBMIT_CREDENTIAL
---
Minh: "Thoi thu dang nhap xem..."
<<trace TRACE_SUBMIT_CREDENTIAL 2>>

<<switch_ui "normal">>
// Sau khi bi lo tai khoan, quay sang hoi Huy/Quan
<<set_objective "OBJ_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES_AFTER_RISK">>
===

title: CH1_M1_CLOSE_LINK
---
Minh: "Thoi dong lai. Cai nay co mui." 
<<trace TRACE_DETECT_RED_FLAG 3>>

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES">>
===

title: CH1_M1_ASK_ROOMMATES
---
<<jump CH1_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES>>
===

title: CH1_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES
---
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 4>>
<<switch_ui "normal">>

Quan: "Link nay nhin kha nghi."
Huy: "Kiem tra nguon truoc. Tai lieu thi nen lay tu LMS hoac nhom lop."
<<trace TRACE_INSPECT_SOURCE 5>>

<<jump CH1_M1_END>>
===

title: CH1_M1_SKIP
---
Minh: "Thay no hoi la, bo qua vay."
<<trace TRACE_DETECT_RED_FLAG 6>>

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<jump CH1_M1_END>>
===

title: CH1_M1_TALK_ROOMMATES_AFTER_RISK
---
// Node nay goi khi vua lo tai khoan va quay sang hoi Huy/Quan
Quan: "Ong vua nhap mat khau vao do ha?"
Huy: "Doi mat khau li, dang xuat thiet bi la, bat 2FA."
Huy: "Tai lieu hoc khong bao gio can mat khau mang xa hoi." 

<<jump CH1_M1_END>>
===

title: CH1_M1_END
---
// Ket thuc M1, chuyen sang M2
<<set_milestone 2>>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M2_PHONE_CALL">>
===
